sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Auth as Auth Service
    participant DB as Database

    User->>App: Tap "Sign in"
    App->>+API: POST /login
    API->>+Auth: Verify credentials
    Auth->>+DB: SELECT user
    DB-->>-Auth: user row
    alt Credentials valid
        Auth-->>API: 200 + JWT
        API-->>App: Session token
        App-->>User: Home screen
    else Invalid password
        Auth-->>-API: 401 Unauthorized
        API-->>-App: Error
        App-->>User: "Try again"
    end
    Note over App,API: Token is refreshed every 15 min
    loop Every 15 minutes
        App->>API: POST /refresh
        API-->>App: New token
    end
    par Analytics
        App-)API: Track event
    and Push
        API-)App: Notification
    end
    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
        User->>App: Log out
        App-xAPI: DELETE /session
    end
